      "nextStep": "Capture a slow authenticated PostgREST trace/query plan with its actual parameters. The direct SQL probe had an inactive session and returned zero visible rows, so its timing is invalid as a performance benchmark. No live staff session was available for a representative replay. No RLS or index changes were made speculatively."
