      "priority": 2,
      "area": "Logout",
      "evidence": "Server duration reported p95 2498ms across 15 invocations. Cleanup additionally waits up to 2s for application storage, and Clear-Site-Data cache previously evicted public HTTP assets.",
      "change": "After durable database revocation succeeds, schedule the captured-token provider logout with Next after(). Clear cookies before responding and retain private HTTP-cache/storage cleanup. If database revocation is not confirmed or the token is missing, await normal provider sign-out. The cache-clearing optimization was deliberately not shipped because signed private media may be cached."
    },
